============================================================================================================================================================
Version: TAKOYAKI_DLS00V008
Patches: The following patches are combined on the basis of the original release SDK
	(1) Spinand master film production failed
	(2) Probabilistic kernel deadlock serial port without printing
	(3) Close coreudmp
	(4) The network port light is off
============================================================================================================================================================
TAKOYAKI_DLS00V008 compilation instructions:
1. Put boot, kernel, project, sdk, Release_to_customer.sh in the same directory
2. Use Release_to_customer.sh to fully compile
	(1) The compiled version is: ssd201 + nor, execute the script: ./Release_to_customer.sh -p ssd201 -f nor
	(2) The compiled version is: ssd201 + nor + fastboot, execute the script: ./Release_to_customer.sh -p ssd201 -f nor -q fastboot
	(3) The compiled version is: ssd201 + nand, execute the script: ./Release_to_customer.sh -p ssd201 -f nand
	(4) The compiled version is: ssd201 + nand + fastboot, execute the script: ./Release_to_customer.sh -p ssd201 -f nand -q fastboot
	(5) The compiled version is: ssd202 + nor, execute the script: ./Release_to_customer.sh -p ssd202 -f nor
	(6) The compiled version is: ssd202 + nor + fastboot, execute the script: ./Release_to_customer.sh -p ssd202 -f nor -q fastboot
	(7) The compiled version is: ssd202 + nand, execute the script: ./Release_to_customer.sh -p ssd202 -f nand
	(8) The compiled version is: ssd202 + nand + fastboot, execute the script: ./Release_to_customer.sh -p ssd202 -f nand -q fastboot
3. Use build_project.sh (under the project directory) to compile the project separately. The parameters of this script are the same as those of Release_to_customer
4. Use build_boot.sh (under the boot directory) to compile the boot and update it to the project (you need to recompile the project), the script parameter is -f nor or -f nand, without parameters the default is nand
5. Use build_kernel.sh (under the kernel directory) to compile the kernel, the script parameter is -f nand -q fastboot or -f nor -q fastboot, and no parameter is nand normal kernel
============================================================================================================================================================
TAKOYAKI_DLS00V008 UI configuration description:
1. Normal version
	(1) Configuration file nvr_i2m_display_glibc_tailor.mk
	(2) File path: /project/release/customer_tailor
	(3) Configuration method: modify the configuration file and enable the UI, such as specifying zk_full: verify_zk_full:=enable
2. Fastboot version
	(1) Configuration file nvr_i2m_display_fastboot_glibc_tailor.mk
	(2) File path: /project/release/customer_tailor
	(3) Configuration method: change the configuration file and enable the UI, such as specifying zk_full_fastboot: verify_zk_full_fastboot:=enable
============================================================================================================================================================
TAKOYAKI_DLS00V008 UI authorization description:
1. Authorized version UI: zk_full_security, the source code download path of its compilation screen parameters: https://github.com/aaron201912/UuidSSDPlayer
2. Unauthorized version UI: All UIs except zk_full_security are unauthorized. The UI will be restarted every 30 minutes. The source code download path of the unauthorized version compilation screen parameters:
   https://github.com/aaron201912/SSD_PLAYER
============================================================================================================================================================
TAKOYAKI_DLS00V008 upgrade instructions:
1. ISP Tool upgrade: Generally, it is not possible to upgrade from an empty chip or under uboot. You need to use ISP to upgrade first before using other methods to upgrade.
	It should be noted that: because the printing and programming are connected to the same SPI interface, you must first disconnect the printing when programming, and then re-power on. You need to click connect immediately at the moment of power-on
2. TFTP upgrade, the upgrade tool is tftpd32.exe, and the upgrade steps are:
	(1) Open tftpd32 and point the current directory to ../project/image/output/images
	(2) Configure the static IP of the computer network card as 192.168.1.127 and the gateway: 192.168.1.1. The static IP is set to prevent the upgrade from changing due to IP changes during the upgrade process.
	(3) The network configuration of the computer and the development board must be configured in the same local area network
	(4) Use the network cable to connect to the development board eth0, press the Enter key, power on the board again, enter the command line mode, and enter the following commands:
	 			a. setenv ipaddr 192.168.1.100
	 			b. setenv serverip 192.168.1.127
	 			c. saveenv
	 			d. estar (upgrade instruction)
3. U disk upgrade
	(1) After compiling the project, execute the script make_usb_upgrade_sigmastar.sh to make the U disk upgrade bin file. No parameters are required to execute the script. In addition, in the process of making the bin, all options are y
	(2) The generated bin file path is: ../project/image/output/images
	(3) Copy SigmastarUpgrade.bin to U disk
	(4) Press the Enter key, power on the board again, enter the command line mode, and enter the following commands:
	 			a. setenv UpgradePort 1
	 			b. saveenv
	 			c. usbstar
4. SD card upgrade
	(1) After compiling the project, execute the script make_sd_upgrade_sigmastar.sh to create the bin file for U disk upgrade. No parameters are required to execute the script. In addition, during the bin creation process, all options are y
	(2) The generated bin file path is: ../project/image/output/images
	(3) Copy SigmastarUpgradeSD.bin to SD card
	(4) Press the Enter key, power on the board again, enter the command line mode, and enter the following command: sdstar
============================================================================================================================================================
